00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.860
- Oh, my bunnies I talked to
you about now live in Montana.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.693
My ranch in Montana.

00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:25.470
- Yes. Okay.
- Yes. It's better for them.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.907
